# Untitled

Breaking pore size limit of metal–organic frameworks: Bio-etched ZIF-8 for lactase immobilization and delivery in vivo
Xiaoyue Qi\(^{1,2}\) (✉), Qizhe Chen\(^{3}\), Ziyong Chang\(^{4}\), and Yulin Deng\(^{5}\)
\(^{1}\) School of Medical Technology, Beijing Institute of Technology, Beijing 100081, China  \(^{2}\) Institute of Engineering Medicine, Beijing Institute of Technology, Beijing 100081, China  \(^{3}\) Institute of Chemistry, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100190, China  \(^{4}\) Civil and Resource Engineering School, University of Science and Technology Beijing, Beijing 100083, China  \(^{5}\) School of Life Science, Beijing Institute of Technology, Beijing 100081, China
